        ("done", "M3 group 1, the marker stand-ins (2026-10-18, `feature/port-markers` 452d265, [RE/31c](31c_port_markers_2026_10_18.md), IDA-verified): takeoff feet (event 68 on the pose, the ledge rebound and the free-run impulsion on the item word, the FreeRun wait's item); the kiosk entry side from the stall entity's forward; the ladder back turn's rates (2.0 / 1.6); the ledge corner turn's body boxes and LateralPathFree, the ledge-to-ladder path, the one-hand pull-up's drop measurement, the vertical rows' last-hand height, the second-hand grab's X+3; the climb-out's probe fallback; the climb start's pose room and path rays (shared by ground and beam); the turn always the shorter way (HG+1776 never set). Full replay: 9 better, 1 worse (the walling knife-edge's batch twin), 135 match to the end (was 134); 588 tests pass"),
